## 9. AI Prompt Design Principles

- Prompts must specify: question format (4-option MCQ), difficulty distribution (30% easy, 50% medium, 20% hard per thread), target domain, and output JSON schema.
- Prompts must explicitly instruct: "Do NOT reproduce any text verbatim from the ISO 27001:2022 standard. Paraphrase all clause concepts."
- Each prompt includes 2-3 "distractor design instructions" to ensure wrong options represent plausible auditor mistakes (e.g., confusing Clause 6.1.2 with 6.1.3).
- System prompt establishes the AI as an "ISO 27001:2022 examination designer" persona.
- Temperature: 0.8 (controlled creativity without hallucination risk).
- Max tokens per thread: 4000 (sufficient for 10 well-formed questions).

